<title>USA: Hamilton Cty, Ohio, won by Seasongood &amp; Mayer.</title>
<headline>Hamilton Cty, Ohio, won by Seasongood &amp; Mayer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seasongood &amp; Mayer said it won $24.850 million of Hamilton Cty, Ohio., building improvement limited tax bonds, Series 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 5.189 percent.</p>
</text>
